messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 328739002 and 386190257? Please reason step by step.', '<think>.\nTo find the sum of 328739002 and 386190257, we can follow these steps:.\n\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, starting from the rightmost digit (units place). This will make it easier to add the numbers column by column.\n\n2. Add the digits in the units place: 2 + 7 = 9. Write down 9 in the units place of the sum.\n\n3. Move to the next column (tens place). Add the digits: 0 + 5 = 5. Write down 5 in the tens place of the sum.\n\n4. Continue this process for each column, moving from right to left. For example, in the hundreds place, add 9 + 2 = 11. Write down 1 in the hundreds place of the sum and carry over 1 to the thousands place.\n\n5. In the thousands place, add the digits along with the carried over value: 3 + 1 + 9 = 13. Write down 3 in the thousands place of the sum and carry over 1 to the ten-thousands place.\n\n6. Repeat this process for each column until you reach the leftmost column (billions place). In this case, add the digits along with the carried over value: 3 + 3 + 8 = 14. Write down 4 in the billions place of the sum and carry over 1 to the trillions place.\n\n7. Finally, write down the carried over value in the trillions place.\n\nAfter completing all the steps, the sum of 328739002 and 386190257 is 714929259.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
